</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Most&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;last&nbsp;collapsible,&nbsp;in&nbsp;fact,&nbsp;isn't&nbsp;majorly&nbsp;interesting&nbsp;in&nbsp;my&nbsp;eyes...&nbsp;</a></div>
