<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I just thought that it would simply be a logical candidate for one of the few things the Foundation is willing to destroy instead of keep trying to contain; by its nature, it will constantly be 'escaping', and each time, it has the risk of some unfortunate circumstance happening.</p>
<p>This may be another instance of &quot;<em>ok that makes sense if this were an actual report, but as a work of fiction, 'meh'</em>&quot;.</p>
</div>
