<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>The main ones I was thinking of were the rock-eggs (otherwise they just felt a bit thrown in)</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Actually I was considering making them an SCP of their own later on. Do you thing such a blatant connection is in bad taste? To be fair, literally the only relation between the lamp and the moon 'rocks' is how the latter got into Foundation custody; everything else would be entirely independent.</p>
</div>
