														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2703042">
									

<p>I've been wondering about this SCP all day, ever since I first read through it. On the first hand, it's not terribly interesting and it's pretty long (in fact, in my first read I caught myself glancing through about half the article). But on the other hand, I consider this to be an impressive feat. This is perhaps the closest we can get to a real, in-universe SCP article while still maintaining readability. It's well-thought out, and pretty much every possibility has been considered in terms of what the Foundation can do with a teleporting lamp. An article like this is a good representation of what the Foundation is: Contain the unexplainable, and scientifically deduce what it is and how it works.</p>
<p>And because of this, I will upvote.</p>

